      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EBurnt Cream Sauce.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n967. Put two ounces of sifted sugar on the fire, in a small saucepan, stir it, and when quite brown pour slowly in a gill of thin cream, stirring it all the time. To be used as a sauce to custard, or batter pudding.\u003Cbr\u003E"
